# A capitalized terminal that no token declares is undefined, even when a
# rule has its name in lower case (only @as promotes words to terminals).
# error: undefined_token_like_rule.grammar:15:5:
# error: undefined token 'EXPR'
@lexer
tokens
    ident
    eof
    err
[ \t\n]+ → skip
[a-z]+ → ident
. → err
@parser
s = expr
  | EXPR IDENT → 2
expr = IDENT IDENT → 1
